---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<Base title={`About · ${profile.name}`}>
  <main class="page">
    <a class="back" href="/">&larr; home</a>

    <header class="head">
      <img class="portrait" src="/portrait.jpg" alt={`Portrait of ${profile.name}`} width="72" height="72" />
      <div>
        <p class="label">About</p>
        <h1 class="name">{profile.name}</h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="intro">
      I'm a researcher and builder at heart, working on agentic and generative AI systems. I earned
      a PhD in applied machine learning and I'm a Google Developer Expert in AI/ML.
    </p>
    <p class="intro">
      <strong>Interests.</strong> I'm interested in building scalable agentic systems for retrieval
      and analytics, with a special interest in open-weight models. Earlier, my research was in
      machine learning applications in wearable systems and biomedical signal processing.
    </p>
    <p class="intro">
      <strong>Open source.</strong> Most of my work is open source. I created
      <a href="https://github.com/PromtEngineer/localGPT">localGPT</a>, one of the earliest fully
      private, on-device retrieval systems and now one of the most widely used, which lets you chat
      with your own documents without anything leaving your machine. I also built
      <a href="https://github.com/PromtEngineer/Verbi">Verbi</a>, a provider-agnostic
      speech-to-speech system. I'm currently building <a href="https://whryte.com">whryte</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="intro">
      <strong>Industry.</strong> As an AI expert, I work with companies to strategize
      and ship AI solutions, from early design through implementation, with a focus on agentic
      systems and retrieval. I speak regularly at tech conferences, including
      <a href="https://www.googlecloudevents.com/next-vegas/speaker/2142477/muhammad-farooq">Google Cloud Next</a>
      in 2025 and 2026. I share what I learn with a large community of engineers on my YouTube
      channel, <a href={profile.links.youtube}>Prompt Engineering</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="intro">
      <strong>Writing and research.</strong> My research has been
      <a href={profile.links.scholar}>cited more than 2,000 times</a>, with
      peer-reviewed work published in
      <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-018-37161-x">Scientific Reports</a>, part of
      the Nature Portfolio. I also write essays on retrieval, reasoning, and local AI here on this
      site.
    </p>

    <nav class="links" aria-label="Continue">
      <a class="more" href="/writing">Writing<span class="arrow">&nbsp;&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="more" href="/consulting">AI consulting<span class="arrow">&nbsp;&rarr;</span></a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 3rem clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 5rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .back {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back:hover,
  .back:focus-visible {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 2.2rem;
  }

  .portrait {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(110, 103, 94, 0.5);
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }

  .name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 480;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .intro a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: var(--rule-ink);
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .intro a:hover,
  .intro a:focus-visible {
    text-decoration-color: var(--ink);
  }

  .intro strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  /* ——— continue ——— */

  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .more {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .more:hover,
  .more:focus-visible {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .arrow {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .more:hover .arrow,
  .more:focus-visible .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .arrow,
    .more {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
